11
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:34,080
This...

12
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:36,120
This is Juan,

13
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:38,280
Zizhou's mother.

14
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:41,320
Xiaoquan.

15
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:47,400
