16
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:47,840
Don't run!

17
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:48,600
Stop!

18
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:49,360
Stop!

19
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:50,200
Stop!

20
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:51,560
Second Uncle,

21
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:53,920
