I'll go.

27
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:02,600
Stop!

28
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,560
- Stop! - Stop!

29
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:09,640
Stop!

30
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:37,960
Lu Gao.

31
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:46,800
Zong Hai.

32
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,400
Zong Hai, where are you?

33
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:53,080
I got the evidence of your crimes with He Zhengnian.

34
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:54,720
Don't do anything reckless.

35
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,480
