38
00:03:59,320 --> 00:03:59,880
Just do it.

39
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:53,400
Zhengnian.

40
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:55,120
Huan.

41
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:57,880
I'll handle these matters

42
00:04:58,640 --> 00:04:59,440
