74
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:06,600
Keep quiet!

75
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:07,960
I'll take you to find Mom.

76
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:12,080
Don't cry, child.

77
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:13,080
Hurry.

78
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:14,400
We can't alert the bad guys.

79
00:06:16,880 --> 00:06:17,680
Mom.

80
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:21,440
Mom, wake up.

81
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:22,800
Wake up.

82
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:25,040
It's me, Zizhou.

83
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:27,680
Mom.

84
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:29,080
Come home with me.

85
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:31,120
I want to go home.

86
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:34,520
Mom.

87
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:49,560
Come on.

88
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,240
Someone's coming.

89
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:51,760
But my mom...

90
00:06:52,080 --> 00:06:52,880
No time left.

91
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:21,000
Kid.

92
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,360
Don't cry.

93
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:26,400
I took your mother's last photo

94
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:29,120
