95
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,160
Mom.

96
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:39,000
Mom.

97
00:07:43,320 --> 00:07:46,160
Uncle, what should I do now?

98
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:47,680
Blood for blood.

99
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:49,840
An eye for an eye.

100
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,640
We share the same enemy.

101
00:07:56,880 --> 00:07:58,120
You're Du Juan's son.

102
00:07:59,200 --> 00:08:00,560
Just call me Uncle Huo from now on.

103
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:02,720
To protect yourself,

104
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,160
