105
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:05,680
that we know each other.

106
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:18,880
This is the only book

107
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:21,400
my father brought with him when he came to Helie from Huaxia

108
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,480
