111
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,600
I hope it will help you in the future.

112
00:08:29,880 --> 00:08:31,160
Thank you, Uncle Huo.

113
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:32,880
Then I must master it.

114
00:08:33,040 --> 00:08:33,840
Good boy.

115
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:36,640
After you've learned it,

116
00:08:37,560 --> 00:08:38,680
I will tell you

117
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:40,560
who really killed your mother

118
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:43,480
