140
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:39,520
Wrongful cases are hard to clear.

141
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:45,080
I hope you protect yourself well.

142
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:46,840
When you grow up,

143
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:49,240
