155
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:25,480
Lily and Xiaoxiao.

156
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,000
Back to Shazhou?

157
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:29,400
Your sister's daughters?

158
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,320
