168
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:21,280
Now that you've both grown up,

169
00:11:21,680 --> 00:11:24,040
you must find out who harmed your sister

170
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:24,680
and

171
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:27,400
