179
00:11:59,880 --> 00:12:00,440
Zizhou.

180
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:04,880
I can't wait anymore.

181
00:12:05,880 --> 00:12:07,120
Since we can't wait,

182
00:12:07,680 --> 00:12:09,160
we don't have to wait any longer.

183
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:13,080
Let evil

184
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:15,520
