188
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:43,120
Males include:

189
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,800
Jin Junyi, Lin Changhao.

190
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:46,120
Females include:

191
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:49,640
Amina, Nora, Gao Mei'er, Xie Liluo.

192
00:12:50,880 --> 00:12:54,280
Liluo, Amina, Nora.

193
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:58,200
Xiaoxiao is already improving.

194
00:12:58,760 --> 00:13:01,120
To prevent He Huan from sending assassins to her,

195
00:13:01,520 --> 00:13:02,040
Lily

196
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:04,000
