197
00:13:04,040 --> 00:13:05,520
as Xiaoxiao.

198
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:07,080
Tomorrow,

199
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:08,920
I'll release Jin Junyi.

200
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:13,960
I'll send Lily to Jeton Art Center.

201
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:15,800
From now on,

202
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:17,640
we need to use psychological strategy

203
00:13:18,160 --> 00:13:19,520
to end it quick.

204
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:28,840
Liluo.

205
00:13:29,040 --> 00:13:30,040
Don't rush.

206
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:30,800
You just became an adult

207
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:31,560
