208
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:32,880
Haven't even celebrated your birthday yet.

209
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:35,200
Don't drive so fast. It's dangerous.

210
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:38,240
Yan Xiaoxiao isn't dead yet,

211
00:13:38,640 --> 00:13:39,480
but she

212
00:13:39,680 --> 00:13:41,080
