213
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:42,400
I don't care.

214
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:43,720
My mom said

215
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:45,800
Yan Xiaoxiao must die.

216
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:48,280
Where's Jin Junyi?

217
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:50,280
Don't mention it.

218
00:13:50,400 --> 00:13:52,080
The day Yan Xiaoxiao jumped,

219
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:54,040
I sent two thugs from Doll Bar

220
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:56,120
