221
00:13:56,160 --> 00:13:57,960
But even Skinny thug, Jia Bao'er,

222
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:59,320
vanished.

223
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:01,040
After

224
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:03,040
