234
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:22,520
You didn't go to Heisongpo to find him?

235
00:14:22,760 --> 00:14:23,720
Then who went?

236
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:26,760
My men took another car and went.

237
00:14:27,520 --> 00:14:28,680
They reported to me

238
00:14:28,880 --> 00:14:30,080
