257
00:15:05,560 --> 00:15:06,840
None are as good as Skinny.

258
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:08,320
I'll have to go find him myself.

259
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,120
Enough talk.

260
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:09,880
Go now.

261
00:15:10,040 --> 00:15:11,600
There's a Jeep parked behind.

262
00:15:12,040 --> 00:15:12,840
Take it.

263
00:15:12,920 --> 00:15:13,440
If there's news,

264
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:14,560
