269
00:15:20,240 --> 00:15:22,040
and I'm still busting my butt to find someone for you.

270
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:23,680
I am definitely

271
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:25,000
the one in the world

272
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:26,800
