273
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:30,200
There are plenty of people who treat me well.

274
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:32,280
Jin Junyi is one of them.

275
00:15:32,920 --> 00:15:34,640
So go find him now.

276
00:15:36,760 --> 00:15:38,240
You said you don't like him,

277
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:39,080
but you're

278
00:15:39,320 --> 00:15:40,440
pretty concerned about him.

279
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:41,960
Hell no!

280
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,560
Stop guessing my thoughts.

281
00:15:47,680 --> 00:15:48,760
With such a temper,

282
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:50,440
who would like you?

283
00:15:51,880 --> 00:15:53,680
Only you and your mom,

284
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:54,800
that stupid and evil bitch,

285
00:15:54,920 --> 00:15:58,000
dare to live in a spooky villa

286
00:15:58,040 --> 00:15:58,920
like this.

287
00:15:59,560 --> 00:16:01,640
You have no charm at all.

288
00:16:02,040 --> 00:16:03,640
I wonder what these men

289
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:05,080
see in you.

290
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:11,040
Your uncle is still waiting for me.

291
00:16:11,920 --> 00:16:13,480
Who knows

292
00:16:13,760 --> 00:16:15,280
